      "message": "while testing, we found several classes are missing.\n\n-keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class com.android.server.wm.WindowManagerGlobalLock { \u003cinit\u003e(); }\n-keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class com.android.server.pm.PackageManagerTracedLock { \u003cinit\u003e(); }\n-keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class com.android.server.am.ActivityManagerProcLock { \u003cinit\u003e(); }\n-keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class com.android.server.pm.PackageDexOptimizer** { \u003cinit\u003e(); }\n-keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class com.android.server.pm.dex.ArtStatsLogUtils** { \u003cinit\u003e(); }\n-keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class com.android.server.criticalevents.CriticalEventLog** { \u003cinit\u003e(); }\n-keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class com.android.server.am.DropboxRateLimiter** { \u003cinit\u003e(); }\n-keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class com.android.server.wm.LockTaskController** { \u003cinit\u003e(); }\n-keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class com.android.server.display.LocalDisplayAdapter** { \u003cinit\u003e(); }\n-keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class com.android.server.am.CacheOomRanker** { \u003cinit\u003e(); }\n-keep,allowoptimization,allowaccessmodification class com.android.server.display.DisplayManagerService** { \u003cinit\u003e(); }",
