      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for flagging!\n\nIt would be great to understand why these are being optimized away. We\u0027re generally trying to move toward annotation-based keep rules rather than global declarative ones, might be interesting to dive into a couple of these and see why they\u0027re removed (and why that breaks behavior) when optimizations are enabled.",
